    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        LIBERO-Plus: In-depth Robustness Analysis of <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-Action <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fei%2C+S">Senyu Fei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+S">Siyin Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shi%2C+J">Junhao Shi</a>, 
      
